The '''Bakura Trace''' was a [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] that connected the [[planet]] [[Endor]] to [[Sanyassa]] and then Sanyassa to [[Ast Kikorie]] in the [[Moddell sector]] before continuing on from Ast Kikorie beyond the borders of the [[sector]].<ref name="BMF18" /> Heading westward, the route met another at [[Cermau]] before extending into [[Wild Space]] and finally ending at [[Bakura]].<ref name="Map" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], the Bakura Trace was mentioned in the [[2015]] magazine [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 18|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 18]].<ref name="BMF18" /> The [[Hapes Cluster/Legends|cluster]] originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it first appeared in the [[1994]] novel ''[[The Courtship of Princess Leia]]'', which was written by [[Dave Wolverton]].<ref name="CoPL">''[[The Courtship of Princess Leia]]''</ref>

